                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="top-profile" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="profile-top-tab">


                                                            <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Unique Design and Durable Build<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Flaunting a back glass infused with colour, the iPhone 15 is sure to grab eyeballs everywhere you go. With a custom dual-ion exchange process and aerospace-grade aluminium enclosure, this phone is robust. Plus, its Ceramic Shield front provides protection against scratches, maintaining the pristine look of your device.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Vivid Display<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Experience the brilliance of the 6.1-inch 2556x1179 Super Retina XDR display, which is bright enough to be visible in direct sunlight. Whether you're outdoors on a sunny day or by the poolside, you'll appreciate the enhanced visibility and clarity this display provides.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Dynamic Island<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Stay updated with Dynamic Island, which conveniently presents alerts and Live Activities without interrupting your tasks. Whether you're tracking your next ride, checking the flight status, or answering calls, you won't miss important updates while multitasking.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Advanced Camera System<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Capture stunning photos with this iPhone's advanced camera system, which features a 48MP main camera, a 12MP ultra-wide camera, and a 12MP 2x telephoto camera. The 12MP TrueDepth front camera delivers high-quality selfies and clear video calls. Moreover, its smart HDR technology ensures optimal lighting for both subjects and backgrounds, resulting in vivid colours and lifelike skin tones. And Night mode activates automatically in low-light environments, producing vibrant hues and sharp details.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Shoot Cinematic Videos<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Elevate your videography with this Apple iPhone's HDR video recording with Dolby Vision up to 4K at 60 fps. So, your videos can showcase sharp detail, colour accuracy, and contrast. Moreover, the Action mode ensures smooth and stable handheld shots, enhancing the quality of your videos.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Smooth and Lag-Free Performance<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Housing the A16 Bionic chip, the iPhone 15 executes tasks smoothly and efficiently. Whether you're multitasking or running resource-intensive applications, this chip ensures a responsive and lag-free user experience.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Generous Storage Space<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">With a high-capacity storage of 128GB, this iPhone gives you ample room to save your favourite apps, photos, videos, music, documents, and more. So, you need not worry about running out of space for your precious memories.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Resistant to Water and Dust<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Rated IP68, this 6.1-inch smartphone is not only resistant to splashes and water but also dust. So, your device remains protected in various environments and weather conditions.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">USB-Compatible<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Featuring a handy USB-C connector, this Apple smartphone enables you to use the same cable for charging your Mac, iPad, and iPhone. So, bid adieu to cable clutter as you can even use your iPhone 15 to charge your Apple Watch or AirPods. Moreover, it supports fast charging so that your device can be powered on in no time.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Wireless Charging<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Its 15W MagSafe wireless charging technology ensures a cable-free and user-friendly charging experience, making it a convenient choice for daily use.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Crash Detection<o:p></o:p></span></p><p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">Utilising hardware sensors and advanced motion algorithms, this iPhone can identify signs of a severe car crash. In the event of an accident, your iPhone can automatically call emergency services and notify your designated emergency contacts, providing valuable assistance when you need it most.</p>
                            
                        </div>
